1
00:00:00,765 --> 00:00:04,315
(Howard:)I'm sorry, Ma,
I have to stay late at the office.

2
00:00:04,477 --> 00:00:07,437
No, he doesn't. He's lying to you.

3
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:09,528
(Howard:)Will you be quiet?

4
00:00:09,691 --> 00:00:12,401
(Raj:)Well, if you want privacy,
let go of the ring.

5
00:00:12,569 --> 00:00:15,949
(Raj:)I'm so glad we came
to this gentile strip club.

6
00:00:16,281 --> 00:00:19,911
(Raj:)Howard, here's more bacon
to tuck into the shiksa's G-string.

7
00:00:20,076 --> 00:00:22,456
[LAUGHS]

8
00:00:22,913 --> 00:00:24,663
(Howard:)I'll call you back.

9
00:00:24,831 --> 00:00:28,331
(Raj:)It's lovely you call your mommy
and let her know you're going to be late.

10
00:00:28,501 --> 00:00:31,461
From what I know, if a woman
doesn't breast-feed on time...

11
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:34,420
(Raj:)...it's very uncomfortable for her boobies.

12
00:00:35,008 --> 00:00:37,468
(Howard:)Don't you talk
about my mother's boobies.

13
00:00:37,636 --> 00:00:41,056
(Raj:)If you're offended, let go of the ring
and go on home to your mother's boobies.

14
00:00:41,222 --> 00:00:42,262
[RAJESH CHUCKLING]

15
00:00:42,432 --> 00:00:44,812
(Sheldon:)Excellent. Tire each other out.
The ring will be mine.

16
00:00:44,976 --> 00:00:47,816
(Sheldon:)Howard, why don't you
go after Raj's mother?

17
00:00:47,979 --> 00:00:50,609
(Raj:)Why don't we go after your mother?

18
00:00:51,816 --> 00:00:55,276
(Raj:)Go ahead.
I have no illusions about my mother.

19
00:00:55,445 --> 00:00:59,535
(Sheldon:)She is a kind, loving,
religiously fanatical right-wing Texan...

